    pr_ref:  # b136
    justification:  # b136
    description: "tracker update --parent accepts short prefixes (e.g., INV-lohap) but stores them literally instead of resolving to full proquint IDs (INV-lohap-jubir-...). This passes at write time but fails tracker validate with 'dangling parent reference'. Other commands (show, update by item_id) correctly resolve short prefixes. Fix: resolve the --parent value through the same prefix-matching logic before storing."  # b136
